#. TRANSLATORS: Command name
#: misc.py:32
msgid "info"
msgstr "info"

#. TRANSLATORS: Command description
#: misc.py:34
msgid "Give you information about the bot."
msgstr "Memberikan informasi tentang bot tersebut."

#: misc.py:44
msgid ""
"MarriageBot is a bot that allows users to marry, divorce, and have children "
"with other users. It also features a unique family tree system that allows "
"users to view their family history and relationships.\n"
"-# MarriageBot is being maintained by [Voxel Fox](https://voxelfox.co.uk)."
msgstr ""
"MarriageBot adalah bot yang memungkinkan pengguna untuk menikah, bercerai, "
"dan memiliki anak dengan pengguna lain. Bot ini juga dilengkapi dengan "
"sistem silsilah keluarga yang unik, yang memungkinkan pengguna untuk melihat "
"riwayat keluarga dan hubungan mereka.\n"
"-# MarriageBot dikelola oleh [Voxel Fox](https://voxelfox.co.uk)."

#: misc.py:52
msgid "Family Tree Members"
msgstr "Anggota Silsilah Keluarga"

#: misc.py:62 misc.py:176
msgid "Donate"
msgstr "Donasi"

#: misc.py:67
msgid "Support Server"
msgstr "Server Dukungan"

#. TRANSLATORS: Command name
#: misc.py:81
msgid "perks"
msgstr "keuntungan"

#. TRANSLATORS: Command description
#: misc.py:83
msgid "Give you information about the bot's premium perks."
msgstr "Memberikan informasi mengenai fitur-fitur premium bot ini."

#. TRANSLATORS: Command name
#: misc.py:94
msgid "donate"
msgstr "berdonasi"

#. TRANSLATORS: Command description
#: misc.py:96
msgid "Give you information about the bot's donation options."
msgstr "Memberikan informasi mengenai opsi donasi bot ini."

#: misc.py:112
msgid "Support MarriageBot"
msgstr "Dukung MarriageBot"

#: misc.py:114
msgid ""
"If you enjoy MarriageBot, please consider donating to support its ongoing "
"maintainance, development, and hosting costs.\n"
"MarriageBot isn't a small bot by any means, and keeping it going requires a "
"lot of time and resources behind the scenes."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda menyukai MarriageBot, mohon pertimbangkan untuk memberikan donasi "
"guna mendukung biaya pemeliharaan, pengembangan, dan hostingnya.\n"
"MarriageBot bukanlah bot yang kecil, dan untuk menjaganya tetap berjalan "
"dibutuhkan banyak waktu dan sumber daya di balik layar."

#: misc.py:120
msgid "Donation Perks"
msgstr "Keuntungan dari Donasi"

#: misc.py:122
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"By supporting MarriageBot, you gain access to exclusive perks depending on "
"your subscription level:\n"
"* Default\n"
"  * 5 children\n"
"  * 1 partner\n"
"* T1\n"
"  * 10 children\n"
"  * 2 partners\n"
"  * Access to {disownall_c}\n"
"* T2\n"
"  * 15 children\n"
"  * 4 partners\n"
"  * Access to {disownall_c}\n"
"  * Access to {fulltree_c}\n"
"* T3\n"
"  * 20 children\n"
"  * 8 partners\n"
"  * Access to {disownall_c}\n"
"  * Access to {fulltree_c}\n"
"In addition, you can buy MarriageBot Gold for your server, which lets your "
"server have its own family tree, and gives you access to the force "
"commands!\n"
"* Default\n"
"  * Global tree\n"
"* Gold\n"
"  * Server-specific tree\n"
"  * Access to the force commands ({forcedivorce_c}, {forcemarry_c}, "
"{forceadopt_c}, {forcerunaway_c})\n"
"  * Access to {incest_c}\n"
"  * T3 perks for all of your server members\n"
msgstr ""
"Dengan mendukung MarriageBot, Anda akan mendapatkan akses ke keuntungan "
"eksklusif sesuai dengan tingkat langganan Anda:\n"
"* Default\n"
"  * 5 anak\n"
"  * 1 pasangan\n"
"* T1\n"
"  * 10 anak\n"
"  * 2 pasangan\n"
"  * Akses ke {disownall_c}\n"
"* T2\n"
"  * 15 anak\n"
"  * 4 pasangan\n"
"  * Akses ke {disownall_c}\n"
"  * Akses ke {fulltree_c}\n"
"* T3\n"
"  * 20 anak\n"
"  * 8 pasangan\n"
"  * Akses ke {disownall_c}\n"
"  * Akses ke {fulltree_c}\n"
"Selain itu, Anda dapat membeli MarriageBot Gold untuk server Anda, yang "
"memungkinkan server Anda memiliki pohon keluarga sendiri, dan memberi Anda "
"akses ke perintah force!\n"
"* Default\n"
"  * Pohon global\n"
"* Gold\n"
"  * Pohon khusus server\n"
"  * Akses ke perintah force ({forcedivorce_c}, {forcemarry_c}, "
"{forceadopt_c}, {forcerunaway_c})\n"
"  * Akses ke {incest_c}\n"
"  * Keuntungan T3 untuk semua anggota server Anda\n"

#: misc.py:162
msgid "How to Support"
msgstr "Cara Memberikan Dukungan"

#: misc.py:164
msgid ""
"Subscriptions can be taken out on the [Voxel Fox website](https://voxelfox."
