#. TRANSLATORS: Command name
#: settings.py:233
msgid "guild-settings guild-specific-families"
msgstr "pengaturan-guild keluarga-guild"

#. TRANSLATORS: Command description
#: settings.py:235
msgid "Set whether or not guild-specific families are enabled for this guild."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan apakah keluarga khusus guild diaktifkan atau tidak untuk guild ini."

#: settings.py:244
msgid ""
"This command cannot be run on the Gold version of MarriageBot. The regular "
"version of MarriageBot now allows you to toggle between guild-specific "
"families and global families.\n"
"\n"
"To use this command, please change over to the regular version of "
"MarriageBot and run this command."
msgstr ""
"Perintah ini tidak dapat dijalankan pada versi Gold MarriageBot. Versi "
"standar MarriageBot kini memungkinkan Anda untuk beralih antara keluarga "
"khusus guild dan keluarga global.\n"
"\n"
"Untuk menggunakan perintah ini, silakan beralih ke versi standar MarriageBot "
"dan jalankan perintah ini."

#: settings.py:263
msgid ""
"You can only switch to guild-specific families (and thus use the `/force` "
"and `/incest` commands, enable polygamy for everyone in your server, and "
"increase your child count) after you have purchased MarriageBot Gold."
msgstr ""
"Anda hanya dapat beralih ke keluarga khusus guild (dan dengan demikian "
"menggunakan perintah `/force` dan `/incest`, mengaktifkan poligami untuk "
"semua orang di server Anda, serta menambah jumlah anak Anda) setelah Anda "
"membeli MarriageBot Gold."

#: settings.py:295
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Guild-specific families are now **enabled** in this guild, and you can now "
"use the force commands.\n"
"Please note that this is a completely seperate tree than the global "
"MarriageBot tree.\n"
"\n"
"You can switch back to the global tree by using the {guild_specific_command} "
"command :3"
msgstr ""
"Fitur keluarga khusus guild kini **telah diaktifkan** di guild ini, dan kamu "
"sekarang dapat menggunakan perintah force.\n"
"Harap diperhatikan bahwa ini adalah pohon fitur yang sepenuhnya terpisah "
"dari pohon MarriageBot global.\n"
"\n"
"Kamu dapat kembali ke pohon global dengan menggunakan perintah "
"{guild_specific_command} :3"

#: settings.py:304
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Guild-specific families are now **disabled** in this guild. You are now "
"switched back to the global MarriageBot tree.\n"
"\n"
"You can switch back to your guild-specific tree by using the "
"{guild_specific_command} command :3"
msgstr ""
"Pohon keluarga khusus guild kini **dinonaktifkan** di guild ini. Anda kini "
"telah dialihkan kembali ke pohon MarriageBot global.\n"
"\n"
"Anda dapat kembali ke pohon khusus guild Anda dengan menggunakan perintah "
"{guild_specific_command} :3"

